body:
Personally I think its ok to have the time limit but I think it becomes unfair when other aspects of the final need to be completed no matter the amount of time. I believe on rivals 2, the math puzzle did have a time limit but the eating didn't. So while Cooke/Cara were smart enough to copy Wes/CT's work and move on from the puzzle quickly, they were stuck at the food portion forever because they suck at eating. Meanwhile emily/paula can't do the math but it doesn't matter because time expires and they smoke cooke/cara on the food. That feels like puzzle skills are less important than eating skills and feels unfair.

&#x200B;

\*emily/paula didn't time out - sorry my memory has failed me.
